Two Homes. One Title. One Significant Opportunity
12 BELLEVUE AVENUE, ROSANNA
House 1 Three Bedrooms One Bathroom 2 car spaces
House 2 Three Bedrooms One Bathroom Double Carport

Occupying a substantial 739m² allotment (approx.) and just a few doors from Rosanna Village and its dining, shopping, café and entertainment options, along with the station, this exceptionally rare combination of two original three-bedroom homes sharing one title presents a compelling opportunity for developers, builders and astute buyers seeking a project with outstanding upside. The generous allotment and dual-home configuration provide an exciting opportunity to utilise the existing footprint and renovate the existing dwellings, eventually living in one, enjoying an income stream from the other, or creating a sanctuary for multi-generational family living. Alternatively, there will be buyers who recognise that the true value lies in the land and seek to unlock its full potential by starting over and creating a luxury new residence or exploring the opportunity for a multi-dwelling redevelopment (STCA). The blue-chip location may also introduce opportunities for medical, dental, allied health or other professional consulting rooms (STCA). A genuine landholding of this scale and versatility is becoming increasingly difficult to secure, making this an exceptional opportunity to unlock its full potential.


